### List venues
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues?page=1&limit=10

### Search venues
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues?q=Aurora

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues/venues-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galaxy Arena",
  "city": "Surat",
  "type": "Auditorium",
  "capacity": 4
}
